     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Hi All,<div>I have few shiny applications on my <a href=\"http://shinyapps.io\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://shinyapps.io&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792360485958000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3bwAodXfkMBkaXG_-WjxU_\">shinyapps.io</a> account. Today, one of my application got deleted by mistake and the delete is permanent and files cannot be recovered. This caused my to loose the app data which was saved by different users of the application. I am now contemplating the idea of the downloading the application bundle everyday (this one particular app is critical and shared among multiple users) from the <a href=\"http://shinyapps.io\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://shinyapps.io&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792360485958000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3bwAodXfkMBkaXG_-WjxU_\">shinyapps.io</a> account. I was wondering if there is a way this process of &quot;downloading the app bundle&quot; could be automated. </div><div><br></div><p style=\"text-align:center;clear:both\"><a href=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-BVxMoWWL2YQ/WdVGO-2zQWI/AAAAAAAAPwk/oaYRdpXFTnAAmnvCZz2cWpy7lnLa9HxhgCLcBGAs/s1600/bundle_download.png\" style=\"clear:left;margin-bottom:1em;float:left;margin-right:1em\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-BVxMoWWL2YQ/WdVGO-2zQWI/AAAAAAAAPwk/oaYRdpXFTnAAmnvCZz2cWpy7lnLa9HxhgCLcBGAs/s1600/bundle_download.png&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792360485958000&amp;usg=AOvVaw143X5egqQsrAprUzEui3zZ\"><img src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-BVxMoWWL2YQ/WdVGO-2zQWI/AAAAAAAAPwk/oaYRdpXFTnAAmnvCZz2cWpy7lnLa9HxhgCLcBGAs/s320/bundle_download.png\" border=\"0\" width=\"320\" height=\"227\"></a></p><div><br></div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div><br></div><di